* Open Lounge Phone behavioural models (ngspice, psa mode). CERN-OHL-S-2.0.
* Every model states the datasheet numbers it is built from; see hardware/sim/README.md. They are
* deliberately simple and only claimed to be good for the quantity the bench checks.

* smooth step (0..1) of width w: keeps Newton happy where a model switches state
.func stp(x,w) {0.5*(1+tanh(x/w))}

* ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* SGM2212-3.3 LDO (SG Micro SGM2212 rev A.2, July 2023). SG Micro publishes no SPICE model.
*  - Output 3.3 V; accuracy 3.251-3.349 V over 0-800 mA and temperature (p5): VREF parameter.
*  - Dropout, 3.3 V version: 380 mV max at 500 mA, 610 mV max at 800 mA (p6) -> pass device
*    as a resistance RDO = 0.76 ohm (max corner) in series with the controlled current.
*  - Current limit >= 810 mA (p6): ILIM.
*  - Loop: transconductance GM from the error to the pass current with an integrator (zero at
*    FZ) for zero static error. For a fast load step the dip is ~ dI/GM; the p7 plot
*    (0 -> ~800 mA, C_OUT 10 uF) shows ~160 mV -> GM ~ 5 A/V. The bench also runs GM/2.
*  - FP: one pole in the loop (assumed 300 kHz; the bench also runs 100 kHz), so the output
*    capacitors, not an ideal loop, carry the first microseconds of a load step.
*  - Start-up: output follows VIN - dropout until regulation (no soft-start data in the
*    datasheet; the integrator limits the ramp).
.subckt SGM2212_BEH VIN VOUT GND PARAMS: VREF=3.3 GM=5 FZ=5k FP=300k RDO=0.76 ILIM=0.81
* conditional integration (anti-windup): stop integrating up at ILIM and down at 0
Bint GND integ I = {GM}*2*3.14159*{FZ}*({VREF}-V(VOUT,GND))*(stp({VREF}-V(VOUT,GND),1m)*stp({ILIM}-V(integ,GND),1m) + stp(V(VOUT,GND)-{VREF},1m)*stp(V(integ,GND),1m))
Cint integ GND 1
Rint integ GND 1e9
Bcmd cmd0 GND V = max(0, min({ILIM}, {GM}*({VREF}-V(VOUT,GND)) + V(integ,GND)))
* error-amplifier / pass-gate pole FP (assumption, no datasheet number): the output caps carry
* the load for the first ~1/(2 pi FP)
Rcmd cmd0 cmd 1k
Ccmd cmd GND {1/(2*3.14159*{FP}*1k)}
Bpass VIN VOUT I = min(V(cmd,GND), max(0, V(VIN,GND)-V(VOUT,GND))/{RDO})
Rleak VOUT GND 1meg
.ends SGM2212_BEH
